---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Inspect local/cloud LLM provider status

Usage: mxr llm [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  status  Show each AI feature's model, the providers it goes through and their health
  key     Manage the Anthropic, OpenAI and OpenRouter API keys used for hosted models
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
